<h2>Project Timeline</h2>
<p>Design finalisation: 2–3 weeks. Manufacturing (modular furniture): 4–6 weeks. On-site installation and finishing: 3–4 weeks. Total realistic timeline for a 2–3BHK: 10–14 weeks from design sign-off, assuming no major civil work delays.</p>
<h2>Transitional vs Other Popular Styles</h2>
